OL,3,AAlexander brothers each sentenced to 30
OL,4,Ayears in prison for sex trafficking
OL,5,Acase
OL,6,
OL,7,FThree brothers - two of them wealthy
OL,8,Freal-estate moguls - were sentenced to
OL,9,F30 years each in prison for drugging
OL,10,Fand raping dozens of women over the
OL,11,Fcourse of decades.
OL,13,FTal Alexander, 40, and twins Oren and
OL,14,FAlon Alexander, 39, were found guilty
OL,15,Fin March of using their wealth and
OL,16,Fsocial status to lure women to parties
OL,17,Fand luxury homes, where they sexually
OL,18,Fassaulted them.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
