OL,3,AAlexander brothers each sentenced to 30
OL,4,Ayears in prison for sex trafficking
OL,5,Acase
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Tuesday morning, the court in New
OL,8,FYork heard from 12 victims, including
OL,9,Fone who did not testify during the
OL,10,Ftrial, about the psychological trauma
OL,11,Fthey endured after the Alexander
OL,12,Fbrothers raped them and their desire
OL,13,Ffor the shame they had felt to instead
OL,14,Ffall on the defendants.
OL,16,FMany asked the judge to impose the
OL,17,Fmaximum sentence of life in prison for
OL,18,Feach brother.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
